          sa('cos θ = -5/13 and θ is in quadrant III. Find θ to the nearest thousandth (0 ≤ θ < 2π).' + TECH, 'θ ≈', key='4.32', note='Accept 4.318 to 4.320. 2π - arccos(-5/13).'),
